    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MS Excel 365 Node\n\n**WHAT IT DOES:**\n* Connects to MS Excel 365 to read, write, and update data\n* Supports operations: append rows, update rows, get rows, clear sheets\n* Requires OAuth2 authentication with Microsoft\n* Can work with multiple sheets in a spreadsheet\n\n**HOW TO USE:**\n2. Select the spreadsheet by ID or from list\n3. Choose operation (append, update, read)\n4. Map columns to your workflow data\n\n**USE CASES:**\n* Recording transaction logs\n* Importing customer data for processing\n* Creating automated reports\n* Syncing data between systems\n\n**REFERENCES:**\nhttps://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/app-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.microsoftexcel/",
        "height": 556,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "9745d353-527d-4b53-a75f-25f399fc0246",
      "name": "Concept",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -128,
        -64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Example\n\n**OPERATION:** Append or Update Row\n* Adds new row if not found\n* Updates existing if match found\n\n**MAPPING:**\n* ID: Static text\n* expense_amount: expense amount for this ID. \nIn this case, it's hard-coded; in the actual workflow, it can also be accessed from the previous node using `{{ $json.fieldName }}`\n* date: Dynamic expression with the current date",
        "height": 328,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "4990ba75-7157-4e41-8efb-dbfe05690d25",
      "name": "Example Details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
